> [The][ Petition][er][ must][ meet][ with][ the][ Planning][ and][ Z][oning][ Department][ prior][ to][ submitting][ any][ applications][.][ This][ permits][ a][ Petition][er][ to][ discuss][ the][ proposal][ with][ Staff][ and][ become][ familiar][ with][ the][ Village][�][�][s][ requirements][ and][ procedures][.][ A][ pre][-][sub][mitt][al][ meeting][ may][ be][ scheduled][ by][ contacting][ the][ Planning][ and][ Z][oning][ Department][ at][ 8][47][-][359][-][90][47][.][
][Completed][ applications][ may][ submitted][ directly][ to][ the][ Department][ of][ Planning][ and][ Z][oning][.]

